      "text": "Follow me, and I will make you fishers of men, Matt. 4:19. take up his cross, and follow me, Mark 8:34 (10:21; Luke 9:23; D&C 56:2). My sheep … follow me, John 10:27. given you an example … do as I have done, John 13:15. I am the way, John 14:6. what is that to thee? follow thou me, John 21:22. Be ye therefore followers of God, Eph. 5:1. was in all points tempted like as we are, Heb. 4:15. yet learned he obedience by the things which he suffered, Heb. 5:8. Christ … an example, that ye should follow his steps, 1 Pet. 2:21. as he is, so are we, 1 Jn. 4:17.",
